    {# intro #}
    {% box_1 "What ?" %}
    The <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Clandestine_Insurgent_Rebel_Clown_Army" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" >Clandestine Insurgent Rebel Clown Army</a> (also known as CIRCA and Clown Army) was an anti-authoritarian left-wing activist group primarily active from 2003 to 2005 in the United Kingdom.<br><br>
    The Clown Army used <strong>clowning</strong> and non-violent tactics to act against corporate globalisation, war, capitalism, and heavy policing of protests, among other issues.
    {% endbox_1 %}


